    "own_line": true,
    "norm": "Verifies that {@link StringSubstitutor#replaceIn(StringBuilder)} collapses the escape sequence \"$$\" into a single \"$\" in place. <p>The source builder is assembled to contain an escaped dollar sign (\"$$\") followed by an empty variable reference (\"${}\"). Because an actual change is made (the escape is collapsed), {@code replaceIn} must return {@code true} and the builder must be updated to hold the collapsed text. The embedded NUL ('\u0000') characters are carried through unchanged.</p>"
